OL,3,GNEWSAPole climbers and chainsaw artists
OL,4,Ato compete at show
OL,5,
OL,6,FTop pole climbers and chainsaw
OL,7,Fsculptors are to compete in the West
OL,8,FMidlands this week at one of the UK's
OL,9,Flargest forestry shows.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, the APF International
OL,12,FForestry Machine Exhibition returns to
OL,13,FRagley Hall near Alcester,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, the show's home since
OL,15,F2012.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
