OL,3,GNEWSAPole climbers and chainsaw artists
OL,4,Ato compete at show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 50th anniversary of the event will
OL,7,Ffeature demonstrations of tree-felling,
OL,8,Ffence-building and high-tech machinery,
OL,9,Fas well as world and European
OL,10,Fchampionships in the 25m (82ft) pole
OL,11,Fclimbing and chainsaw carving
OL,12,Fcompetitions.
OL,14,FExhibition secretary Ian Millward said
OL,15,Forganisers wanted to educate people
OL,16,Fthat growing and selling trees was in
OL,17,Fmost cases "a sustainable thing".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
